flowchart LR
  P[Page loads] --> G{https, no GPC, no Do Not Track?}
  G -- no --> X[nothing sent]
  G -- yes --> B[sendBeacon path, lang, referrer host]
  B --> T[POST /api/track]
  T --> Z{size up to 1 KB, Zod ok, not a bot?}
  Z -- no --> N[204]
  Z -- yes --> S[today's salt, created on first use]
  S --> RL{60 per minute per hashed IP?}
  RL -- over --> N
  RL -- ok --> I[insert page_views, visitor_hash = HMAC of salt, ip, ua, host]
  I --> N
  C[Daily cron] --> R[roll up the last 3 Manila days, production only]
  R --> DEL[delete old views, salts, rate rows, attempts, sessions]
